-- Restore vanilla 1.12 creature respawn timers on Eastern Kingdoms and Kalimdor (vmangos creature
-- spawntimesecsmin/max; their mean where vmangos draws a random delay). Covers 12307 spawns of vanilla
-- creatures (same entry and name, level 63 or lower) that still carry the stock AzerothCore value and
-- match a vanilla spawn of the same entry within 5 yards (the same vanilla guid first). Members of a matched
-- creature formation take the formation's vanilla timer. Game-event, pooled and CoA spawns are excluded.
-- Each update is guarded by the stock value, so a spawn changed elsewhere is left alone.
